at whatever speed your child wants, talking about the pictures as you go.</li>\n<li>If you speak another language at home, talk about the pictures and story in your language.</li>\n<li>Read a story written in another language.</li>\n<li>Add in sound effects and different voices for different characters.</li>\n<li>If it’s a story you’ve read lots of times, stop before the end of a familiar sentence and let your child finish the sentence.</li>\n<li>Make a den by putting a cloth or blanket over a table and have your story in the den.</li>\n<li>Use mini figures to act out a story you know.</li>\n<li>Dress up as characters from a story.</li>\n</ul>", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 45, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 45, "name": "Other Ways to Explore a Story", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-09T11:14:23.711829", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-09T11:14:23.711829", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 36461358, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 45, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36461491, "text": "Find somewhere comfy to sit and listen to a story! Reading a real book is good because it is easy to stop, look at the pictures and talk about what is happening. But for this activity, you could use a story in another format. Here are some suggestions:\n<br></br>\n<ul>\n<li>A book from home, school or the library;</li>\n<li>A YouTube reading of a story;</li>\n<li>A story on CBeebies Radio;</li>\n<li>An audiobook from the library;</li>\n<li>Tell a story you know without using a book.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36461358, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36461491, "text": "Find somewhere comfy to sit and listen to a story! Reading a real book is good because it is easy to stop, look at the pictures and talk about what is happening. But for this activity, you could use a story in another format. Here are some suggestions:\n<br></br>\n<ul>\n<li>A book from home, school or the library;</li>\n<li>A YouTube reading of a story;</li>\n<li>A story on CBeebies Radio;</li>\n<li>An audiobook from the library;</li>\n<li>Tell a story you know without using a book.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36461358, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36461634, "text": "<h2>Top Tips:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Make sure you can both see/hear the story so you can both listen and talk about it.</li>\n<li>Let your child turn the pages (if you’re using a book) – this lets them really look at the pictures and move through the story at their own pace.</li>\n<li>Encourage them to talk about the pictures – you can ask if they can see something specific in the picture, or let them tell you about it.</li>\n<li>When you have finished the story, you can ask them if they liked it and if they had a favourite character.</li>\n</ul>\n\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null